Description: Provides a standardized exploratory workflow for relative
  transcriptomic comparison between human tumors and mouse cancer models. It
  connects explicit input contracts, audited ortholog mapping, module-specific
  analyses, standardized outputs, and package-native visualizations for
  differential expression, uncorrected principal component analysis,
  transcriptome overlap scoring, functional enrichment, and exploratory immune
  and metabolic profiling. The workflow records sample metadata, thresholds,
  mapping provenance, and input checks so users can interpret each result
  against a prespecified research question and module-specific endpoint.
